# Optional Renovate cron fragment.
#
# Disabled by default: copy this file into a host-specific crontab only after
# the dry-run in README.md has succeeded.
#
# The walter-run wrapper must load RENOVATE_TOKEN from Infisical before running
# the service. Keep one explicit repo list or a restrictive autodiscover filter
# in the wrapper's environment.
#
# Example weekly run, Sunday 03:17 UTC:
# 17 3 * * 0 cd /opt/walter-vm/services/renovate && /usr/local/bin/walter-run renovate ./run.sh run >> /var/log/walter-council/renovate.log 2>&1
#
# Manual trigger:
#   cd /opt/walter-vm/services/renovate
#   /usr/local/bin/walter-run renovate ./run.sh dry-run
